# BeatBax NES DMC sample provenance

Feature 109 kit after audition pass 5 (full Michael Fischer 808 WAV kit).
Classic latin/drum files (`kick.dmc`, `snare.dmc`, …) unchanged.

Encoded with `encodeDMCFromPCM` at NTSC dmc_rate=15 unless noted.
`voice_ready` play with dmc_rate=12.

**808 kit:** Michael Fischer TR-808 sample set (1994), CC0 via
https://github.com/tidalcycles/sounds-tr808-fischer — not a ROM dump; original hardware recordings released as free samples.

